            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.21699/jns.v6i3.599</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Closed gastroschisis is a rare entity usually associated with intestinal atresia and short bowel syndrome. We report two cases of closed gastroschisis presenting with neonatal intestinal obstruction and para-umbilical evisceration without an abdominal defect.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
